<km-doc>
<km-title nodeId="9ae07ba7e8bc41078425317332083d1a">策略评估-评估模板</km-title>
<km-catalog style="none" nodeId="1cc2a224a3324890bbde0e59a59b6f74" />
<h2 nodeId="95cf9e55d6d7491d87dd14d9cc849ac6">一、背景</h2>
<p align="start" nodeId="9a893a590d3543c6a1b49ada1f66315f">相见策略评估的背景</p>
<h2 align="start" nodeId="91172cdb18964966851e48b308baa3ec">二、名词解释</h2>
<p align="start" nodeId="71a94b0f2b6a4d4789143de47f6ea9f7">评估模板：便于用户管理一批规则通用的评估逻辑，便于根据模板自动生成评估任务</p>
<h2 align="start" nodeId="875348b4bdc2424181c7a776147b7f15">三、操作指南</h2>
<h3 align="start" nodeId="7150872bd662400183998698fcfc4790">1.用户操作流程说明</h3>
<table borderColor="#cccccc" responsive="false" nodeId="faf59f425ffc4fc181485a068ac30c17">
<tr nodeId="e94b1a85092846ec9e3da21adf1b74d0">
<th colwidth="[620]" nodeId="98ae62d2fb7d49fe92c2c5b26446efc1">
<p nodeId="6fa06bad0f89472bb008b2d7dc5fa689"><span font-size="14">说明</span></p>
<p nodeId="8dc99001045244c092f8addb17db9dc7"><span font-size="14">入口：</span></p>
<p nodeId="e96e15d5503e4bf388dad4e79c724ded"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">zeus--&gt;策略评估--&gt;评估模板--&gt;评估模板tab</span></span></p>
</th>
<th colwidth="[682]" nodeId="0a9a71bc9f7a402b8040e0ba060ad9fa">
<p nodeId="e8a07a57a3d04e008f68fd4920150ab0"><span font-size="14">页面</span></p>
</th>
</tr>
<tr nodeId="9e71023a0155448f875518b5b2033823">
<td colwidth="[620]" nodeId="e59818d5617648da8b8072fa7ff14ec3">
<p nodeId="f4c5bafe94614dc4acf85964b8430be2"><span color=" "><span font-size="14">新建：</span></span></p>
<ol nodeId="61b00fe410ce4d88846178faa8d23ac3">
<li nodeId="4832d82bc71f465c99e2bb3e23ff1c4d"><span font-size="14">点击右上角「新建模板」按钮，进入将新建模板页面</span></li>
<li nodeId="2994dd6cc61a43ddb939888f91bd3c06">
<p nodeId="7a89dee7b6ac40ef85a3b752bb93535a"><span font-size="14">基本信息模板：</span></p>
<p nodeId="ec1bd57430aa4962be774b587bf9b34d"><span font-size="14">必须填写模板名，模板属性（标记模板、在线模板二选一，本期仅上线标记模板）；生效方式（自动、人工二选一，本期仅上线人工模板）</span></p>
<p nodeId="ed09b6aa25824d108eb461d124aa63df"><span font-size="14"><strong>备注：</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="17628fa79e524bef9c5256fbfc613865"><span font-size="14"><strong>属性与规则状态挂钩，标记模板评估标记规则，在线模板评估生效规则；</strong></span></p>
<p nodeId="60caf51b70a847b88d37583b7db8defb"><span font-size="14"><strong>生效方式表明使用该模板的评估任务完成且评估结果通过后，待评估的规则是自动生效还是人工生效，为避免生产问题，本期仅上线人工生效。</strong></span></p>
</li>
<li nodeId="25e79b92dd674ffeb795a8fc7f733a31"><span font-size="14">逻辑配置仅支持模板配置，支持左变量（指标）+操作符+右变量（阈值）的配置方式</span></li>
<li nodeId="d130b4c23fac49a28bbd80ec879b1960"><span font-size="14">指标下拉选项为「评估指标tab」的默认指标和用户配置的自定义指标；</span></li>
<li nodeId="a5b0ae762ed544b4bdfdde2ac773428b"><span font-size="14">操作符为&gt;/&gt;=/==/&lt;=/&lt;</span></li>
<li nodeId="32fbc59fd8f7471dbef8338787fce5d1"><span font-size="14">阈值可以输入数字，支持输入两位小数；</span></li>
<li nodeId="b2045695578d4252a658c886eeb0e9d6"><span font-size="14">每一行可以配置一个指标的判断逻辑，多行之间可以编辑「与/或/非」关系，用户配置复杂逻辑</span></li>
<li nodeId="14a9f8d035844875accb0905dfca867d"><span font-size="14">逻辑预览支持用户查看自己所配逻辑是否符合预期</span></li>
</ol>
<p nodeId="fb676ec37a464da9a94eccefa307052c" />
</td>
